{
  "_doc": [
    "PRESET LIGHTING WITNESS — the per-preset NEW-CAMPAIGN bit witness (LGT-P14-WITNESS).",
    "",
    "WHAT THIS PINS. One row per simulation preset, plus `__birth_default__`: the world a",
    "fresh campaign is born into and what one year of world pulse does to it. Every pulse",
    "golden in the estate drives LITERAL rules, so a change to WHICH preset a new campaign",
    "receives is invisible to all of them. This manifest is the only place that move shows.",
    "",
    "THE ROW THAT MATTERS MOST is `__birth_default__`. It is born with no preset id, so it",
    "resolves NEW_CAMPAIGN_SIMULATION_PRESET_ID. Lighting the shipped default moves it, and",
    "a later silent RE-DARKENING moves it back. Neither can land quietly while this row holds.",
    "",
    "HOW A ROW LAWFULLY MOVES. BY HAND, and only with a stated, legitimate cause recorded",
    "under the estate’s golden-shift discipline (docs/GOLDEN_SHIFT_LEDGER.md), in the same",
    "commit as the change that moved it. This surface has NO capture arm and no env",
    "spelling, deliberately: tests/helpers/goldenRecordDoor.js writes recorded values onto",
    "the golden-freeze register row, and every such value MUST stay null until the freeze",
    "act signs for it, so routing this surface through the door today would poison the",
    "register. The same disposition the interior golden carries.",
    "",
    "THE RE-RECORD RECIPE, reproducible from a clean checkout with no instrument of its own:",
    "",
    "  node --input-type=module -e \"import('./tests/simulation/presetLightingWitnessRun.js')",
    "    .then(async (m) => console.log(JSON.stringify(await m.measureWitness(), null, 2)))\"",
    "",
    "Paste that array into `rows`, then refresh `distinctWorldStateHashes`,",
    "`birthSuccessorPresetIdWhenRecorded` and `presetRosterWhenRecorded` to match the tree.",
    "",
    "THE MEASUREMENT IS NOT RE-IMPLEMENTED ANYWHERE. Both the suite and the minting",
    "instrument import tests/simulation/presetLightingWitnessRun.js, which is the single",
    "writer of these figures.",
    "",
    "REGISTERED at tests/fixtures/.golden-freeze-register.json under the surface identity",
    "`preset-lighting-witness`."
  ],
